    m_Localized: The value {0} already has a power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635969
    m_Localized: The power "{0}" is selected more than once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635970
    m_Localized: This mode needs between {0} and {1} players (you have {2}).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635971
    m_Localized: The number of rounds must be between {0} and {1}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635972
    m_Localized: Every player needs a name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635973
    m_Localized: The name "{0}" is longer than {1} characters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
