    m_Localized: The name "{0}" is used more than once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635975
    m_Localized: Reset
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635976
    m_Localized: Playable on anything. The next player can play any card.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635977
    m_Localized: Burn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635978
    m_Localized: Playable on anything. Burns the discard pile and you play again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635979
    m_Localized: See-through
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635980
    m_Localized: Playable on anything. The next player must beat the card underneath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635981
    m_Localized: Lower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635982
    m_Localized: The next player must play a card of equal or lower value.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635983
    m_Localized: Skip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635984
    m_Localized: The next player misses their turn (one more player per card played).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635985
    m_Localized: Reverse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635986
    m_Localized: The direction of play is reversed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635987
    m_Localized: Forced pick-up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635988
    m_Localized: The next player picks up the discard pile and misses their turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635989
    m_Localized: Play again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143635990
    m_Localized: You play again immediately.
