      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15599575662606
    m_Localized: A complete set burns the pile
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15599575662607
    m_Localized: All the cards of one value played in a row (4 per deck used) burn the pile and the player plays again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15599575662608
    m_Localized: Jump-in play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15599575662609
    m_Localized: Out of turn, play the last card of a complete set of one value (3 already played with one deck, 7 with two...).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
